+**Acceptance criteria:**
+
+- No item of the [`surface-area-report.md`](../.agents/audits/surface-area-report.md) disposition list survives.
+- One canonical prompt per review use case, and no shipped prompt names a payload that is not on disk.
+- `document.md` and `maintenance.md` are invocable under their final names, each confirmed against the `doc-maintenance` register.
+- `bash scripts/lint.sh` and `bash scripts/run_tests.sh` are clean.
+
+**Task items.** They run in this order: the pass family first, because every later item here lands gateless without it; the payload consolidation second, because the runbooks edit what it produces; the runbooks third. The gate `An outgoing-link and file-path gate over the instruction surfaces` in T1 is this item set's verification, so a move or a deletion here does not land unchecked.
